  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "In the competitive world of e-commerce, effective inventory management is crucial for success. The Cart Quantity module of eCommerce SaaS is designed to simplify this process, ensuring that your stock levels are accurately reflected in your online store. By automatically updating inventory as customers add items to their carts, this module helps prevent overselling and maintains the reliability of your stock information. Additionally, you can set the minimum and maximum quantity of products a customer can add to the cart at a time, providing greater control over your inventory.": "I den konkurrenceprægede verden af ​​e-handel er effektiv lagerstyring afgørende for succes. ",
